{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/c9d3ab7d34df75553c6c2dc35e28bbd0.avif?t=1770640403\" width=852 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barks &amp; Bytes</strong> is an online 4-players social deduction card game featuring voice chat, where robot prototypes bluff, swap, expose and outsmart each other to dodge the dreaded Dog Card. Smart decision-making is key to survival, only one makes it through, the others are recycled.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>How to Play:</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Start:</strong> Each player is dealt cards. One player starts with the <i><strong>Dog Card</strong></i>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/150a6455330482e2348a4854444a866a.poster.avif?t=1770640403\" width=640 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/150a6455330482e2348a4854444a866a.webm?t=1770640403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discard</strong>: When a player has a pair, they can discard it. Players must empty their hands to finish a round. At the end of a round one player will remain holding the <strong><i>Dog Card</i></strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/cffd52e17f1b80b859219b269dd73bd4.poster.avif?t=1770640403\" width=640 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/cffd52e17f1b80b859219b269dd73bd4.webm?t=1770640403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give a card:</strong> On a player's turn, they place a card face down for the next player and announce its rank. If the player is passing the <i><strong>Dog Card</strong></i>, they can bluff about the rank.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/2442b755e938185a8708b38cbf1355b7.poster.avif?t=1770640403\" width=640 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/2442b755e938185a8708b38cbf1355b7.webm?t=1770640403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Receiver chooses:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>ACCEPT</strong></i> = Take the card</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>EXPOSE</strong></i> = Call the bluff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>SKIP</strong></i> = Refuse it and request a second card (must be accepted)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/537f9c3e433ded237e1e2a37eda600e9.poster.avif?t=1770640403\" width=640 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/537f9c3e433ded237e1e2a37eda600e9.webm?t=1770640403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stability Points:</strong> Any action considered unstable reduces <i><strong>Stability</strong></i>, the lower your <i><strong>Stability</strong></i>, the higher chance of being recycled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/570c0c806ef4fdab3d799ef137735d32.poster.avif?t=1770640403\" width=640 height=427 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/570c0c806ef4fdab3d799ef137735d32.webm?t=1770640403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dog card:</strong> The most dangerous card. Receiving or holding it can cause <i><strong>instability</strong></i>. Players try to avoid it or pass it on.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/fd286e639147b93d0be0bec1dc0c6010.poster.avif?t=1770640403\" width=640 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/fd286e639147b93d0be0bec1dc0c6010.webm?t=1770640403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>End of round:</strong> At the end of each round, a player can be eliminated for being too unstable, so watch those <i><strong>Stability Points</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/ef98fd350c7ba734af8b7cd69e15106a.poster.avif?t=1770640403\" width=640 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/ef98fd350c7ba734af8b7cd69e15106a.webm?t=1770640403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win:</strong> Players who are considered too unstable are recycled. The last player standing wins.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/2827e7fb2d19f1d737d23e34a7298498.avif?t=1770640403\" width=640 height=427 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3701830?t=1770640403","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/eda53c7d8837d25d6f17e136cbdd6b38205a7d43/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770640403","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/c72576f724c79b7f306781df12d52b5c2da37168/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770640403","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/c72576f724c79b7f306781df12d52b5c2da37168/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770640403","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/c9d3ab7d34df75553c6c2dc35e28bbd0.avif?t=1770640403\" width=852 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barks &amp; Bytes</strong> is an online 4-players social deduction card game featuring voice chat, where robot prototypes bluff, swap, expose and outsmart each other to dodge the dreaded Dog Card. Smart decision-making is key to survival, only one makes it